#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:1
msgid "E0036"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `block_label_shadowing`"
msgstr "警告名称：`block_label_shadowing`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:5
msgid "The label on a block or loop shadows a label that is already in scope."
msgstr "代码块或循环上的标签遮蔽了作用域内已有的标签。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:7
msgid ""
"Block and loop labels share the same namespace. When a label name is "
"reused on a nested block or loop, it shadows the outer label, which can "
"make the target of a labelled `break` or `continue` unclear."
msgstr ""
"代码块标签和循环标签共享同一个命名空间。在嵌套的代码块或循环上重复使用某个标签名时，内部标签会遮蔽外部标签，使带标签的 `break` 或 "
"`continue` 的目标变得不明确。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:11
msgid ""
"Because `break` can target either a block or a loop while `continue` can "
"target a loop, shadowing can redirect control flow to a different "
"construct than intended. Use distinct, descriptive names for nested block"
" and loop labels."
msgstr ""
"`break` 既可以指向代码块也可以指向循环，而 `continue` "
"只能指向循环；因此，标签遮蔽可能把控制流导向与预期不同的结构。请为嵌套代码块和循环的标签使用不同且含义明确的名称。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:15
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:17
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn has_positive(xs : Array[Int]) -> Bool {\n"
"  found~: {\n"
"    // Warning: The label name `found` shadows a label name that is "
"already in scope.\n"
"    found~: for x in xs {\n"
"      if x > 0 {\n"
"        break found~\n"
"      }\n"
"    }\n"
"    false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:21
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:23
msgid ""
"Use distinct, descriptive label names for nested blocks and loops so each"
" control-flow target is unambiguous."
msgstr "为嵌套的代码块和循环使用不同且含义明确的标签名称，使每个控制流目标都清晰无歧义。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0036.md:26
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"fn has_positive(xs : Array[Int]) -> Bool {\n"
"  found~: {\n"
"    search~: for x in xs {\n"
"      if x > 0 {\n"
"        break found~ true\n"
"      }\n"
"      continue search~\n"
"    }\n"
"    false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
